  "lineage": "Traditional Dominican merengue variant of the Cibao region (Santiago, La Vega, Moca, San Francisco de Macorís). Button-accordion (German-immigrant introduction, adopted as canonical), tambora double-headed drum, güira metal-scraper, marímbula or electric-bass, voice. Tatico Henríquez (1944-1976) is the canonical tipico accordionist; Fefita La Grande (born 1943) is the canonical female lead.",
